"the order of the items is important. A number will be associated with each "
"entry, in order, starting from one.\n"
"\n"
"Here is one example of a orderedlist:\n"
"\n"
"<orderedlist>\n"
"\n"
"<listitem><para>\n"
"First item.\n"
"</para></listitem>\n"
"\n"
"<listitem><para>\n"
